    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d423">

                <pb facs="0568" n="556" sameAs="frus:frus1943v03/pg556"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.0061/65: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Standley</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-07-30T17:00:00+03:00">July 30, 1943—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 31—2:38 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>978. Foreign Office has just orally advised the Embassy that the Diplomatic Corps
                    at Kuibyshev will return to Moscow within a month.</p>
                <pb facs="0569" n="557" xml:id="pg557"/>
                <p>When asked whether this decision was to be regarded as confidential until
                    announced Embassy informed that Foreign Office was today advising the Diplomatic
                    Corps.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Standley</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
